sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cron as Job Scheduler
    participant Web as Web (FDA/Trials)
    participant Apollo as Apollo API
    participant DB as Cloud SQL
    participant AI as Anthropic Claude
    participant Resend as Email Service
    participant User as End User (Inbox)

    %% 6-Hour Background Loop
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of Cron: Runs continuously every 6 hours (Background Intel)
        Cron->>Web: Scrape FDA 510(k) clearances & Clinical Trials
        Web-->>Cron: Return parsed public data
        Cron->>DB: Save detected company Triggers
    end

    %% Daily 10 AM Pipeline
    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        Note right of Cron: Runs daily at exactly 10:00 AM EST
        Cron->>Apollo: Fetch new companies & contacts (Leads)
        Apollo-->>Cron: Returns fresh lead data
        Cron->>DB: Save raw leads to Database
        
        Cron->>DB: Fetch associated Triggers for leads
        DB-->>Cron: Return Triggers (from 6-hr scrapers)
        
        Cron->>AI: Send leads + Triggers for ICP scoring
        AI-->>Cron: Returns 0-100 Score + Reasoning
        Cron->>DB: Update leads with AI Scores
        
        loop For each HOT Lead (Score >= 80)
            Cron->>AI: Generate highly personalized 3-step email sequence
            AI-->>Cron: Returns custom Draft 1, 2, and 3
            Cron->>DB: Save outreach sequence as DRAFT
        end
        
        Cron->>DB: Query daily statistics (Total, Hot, Triggers)
        DB-->>Cron: Return stats
        
        Cron->>Resend: Compile HTML Report & dispatch to user
        Resend-->>User: Delivers "IntraIntel Daily Lead Intel" email
    end
    
    User->>User: Reviews report & copies outreach drafts to send